 \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(f\), \(max\)]\)=", 
             $CellContext`numhz[$CellContext`ftmax], " MHz."]; 
           Print["Desvio eficaz de frequ\[EHat]ncia  por canal:  \
\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(\[CapitalDelta]f\), \(ef\)]\)=", 
             $CellContext`numhz[$CellContext`\[CapitalDelta]ftef], " MHz."]; 
           Print["Largura de banda do canal telef\[OAcute]nico:  \
\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(b\), \(s\)]\)=", 
             $CellContext`numhz[$CellContext`bts], 
             " MHz."]; $CellContext`fc = $CellContext`ftmax - \
$CellContext`bts/2; 
           Print["   A frequ\[EHat]ncia m\[EAcute]dia do canal \[EAcute] fc=", 
             $CellContext`numhz[$CellContext`fc], " MHz."]; $CellContext`fr = 
            1.25 $CellContext`ftmax; 
           Print["   A frequ\[EHat]ncia de resson\[AHat]ncia do circuito da \
acentua\[CCedilla]\[ATilde]o \[EAcute] fr=", 
