est\[ATilde]o no cap\[IAcute]tulo 5.5.2, tabela 5.6 [1].\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{36, 48}, {Inherited, Inherited}},
 FontFamily->"Verdana",
 FontSize->11,
 FontColor->RGBColor[0, 0, 1],
 Background->None],

Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {
